OL,3,GNEWSAHospital helipad use suspended
OL,4,Aafter fire breaks out
OL,5,
OL,6,FEmergency services are responding to a
OL,7,Ffire near to a hospital helipad which
OL,8,Fhas led to the suspension of air
OL,9,Fambulance activity.
OL,11,FFire crews have been sent to Prince
OL,12,FCharles Hospital, in Merthyr Tydfil,
OL,13,Fand are working to resolve the
OL,14,Fsituation.
OL,16,FCwm Taf Morgannwg University Health
OL,17,FBoard said patients requiring urgent
OL,18,Fspecialist treatment may be diverted to
OL,19,Falternative hospitals, which could
OL,20,Fresult in delays and longer transfer
OL,21,Ftimes.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,439,430,260,140,0,100
