OL,3,GNEWSAHospital helipad use suspended
OL,4,Aafter fire breaks out
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe health board has reassured patients
OL,7,Fthat the incident is affecting air
OL,8,Fambulance access only, and the
OL,9,Femergency department remains open, if
OL,10,Fany patients require urgent or
OL,11,Femergency care.
